# Vercel Speed Insights Configuration Report

## Summary
Vercel Speed Insights is **already installed and properly configured** in this project.

## Current Implementation Status

### ✅ Package Installation
- **Package**: `@vercel/speed-insights` version `^2.0.0`
- **Location**: `package.json` dependencies
- **Status**: Installed and up-to-date (verified via npm install)

### ✅ Configuration (Vanilla HTML/JavaScript)
The Speed Insights integration follows the official Vercel documentation for vanilla HTML/JavaScript projects.

**Implementation in both HTML files:**
- `index.html` (lines 14-17)
- `gallery.html` (lines 7-10)

```html
<script>
  window.si = window.si || function () { (window.siq = window.siq || []).push(arguments); };
</script>
<script defer src="/_vercel/speed-insights/script.js"></script>
```

This implementation matches the **official Vercel Speed Insights Quickstart documentation** (fetched from https://vercel.com/docs/speed-insights/quickstart on 2026-08-22).

